<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>12 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>10 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>9 - Miladin Becanovic (Lille), Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>8 - Anderson (Monaco), Anto Drobnjak (Bastia), Japhet N'Doram</p>
<p>(Nantes)</p>
<p>7 - Leonardo (Paris St Germain)</p>
<p>6 - Thierry Henry (Monaco), Victor Ikpeba (Monaco)</p>
</text>
